<title>USA: Autozone CEO comfortable with Q4 estimates.</title>
<headline>Autozone CEO comfortable with Q4 estimates.</headline>
<dateline>MEMPHIS, Tenn. 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Johnston Adams, chairman and chief executive officer of AutoZone Inc, said Friday he was comfortable with analysts' estimates for the company's earnings in its fiscal fourth quarter ending August 30.</p>
<p>Adams supported analysts' forecasts, reported by First Call Corp at $0.52 a share, during a meeting with analysts.</p>
</text>
